Tests that run in the linux-m4 PKGBUILD check() and by hand:

  check-modules.py <builddir> --release <kernel release> [--expect-file expected-modules.txt]
      ELF/loader validity of every module (one .modinfo with flags A, one this_module, no SHF_GNU_RETAIN,
      vermagic) and the module list for the VM load test.
  expected-modules.txt
      Modules that must exist.
